PERMISSIONS

Config decides every call: allow, deny, or ask user.
- permission/list
- permission/check
- permission/default
- permission/allow
- permission/deny
- permission/ask
- permission/server
- permission/deny-server
- permission/hide-server
- permission/delete
- permission/clear-all
Change config only when user asks. Denied call: final, no retry, no other route. Ask call: stop, say why in one line, wait.
Signatures, examples, rules: memory/recall "permissions/config" or "permissions/calls", or by trigger.
